Snapshot of the existing esp-idf/components/lwip/lwip core and headers in this
repository, copied without changes for portable FuseX builds. The matchmaking
NO_SYS build compiles only IPv4, raw/ICMP and TCP. Configuration and bridge code
are project-owned in peripherals/nic/match_lwip and peripherals/nic/lwip.c.
See COPYING and upstream file headers for licensing.
